@startuml
title State diagram of the system operations of "Process Sale"

[*] --> WaitingCustomer

state "Waiting for customer" as WaitingCustomer
state "Record items" as RecordItems
state "Payment" as Payment

WaitingCustomer --> RecordItems : enter item
RecordItems --> RecordItems : enter item
RecordItems --> Payment : end of sale (if cash) or CardCheck (if card/check)

Payment --> CashPayment : cash payment
Payment --> CardCheck : card or check payment
CardCheck --> PaymentVerified : approved payment
CardCheck --> PaymentRejected : rejected payment

WaitingCustomer --> WaitingPayment : finished payment (if cash)
Payment --> WaitingPayment : finished payment (if card/check)
WaitingPayment --> EndOfSale : end of sale
EndOfSale --> [*] : return to waiting for next customer

@enduml
